{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一連三場，許志安《On Stage演唱會》今日（10/10）舉行尾場，後台有不少圈中好友致送花籃，其中「四大天王」的張學友、劉德華、郭富城的花籃平排放在當眼處，獨欠黎明未有贈送。</p><figure><img alt=\"許志安演唱會。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185697671072452608916072.jpeg/vUY9EL7mDVraRQIRohdAp0NuzR5W-qdRByP1EDIj9RA\"/><figcaption>許志安演唱會。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四大天王獨欠黎明。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185697668857729024862740.jpeg/lto0yYTpQz6g4L2fi71vXpoNFio_Jq8OKsWNVhzFjVY\"/><figcaption>四大天王獨欠黎明。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><p>三大天王的花籃平排放在後台佈景板左邊，而右邊就有經理人公司神燈娛樂，「Big Four」兄弟張衛健、蘇永康、梁漢文，以及梅艷芳國際歌迷會。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉德華。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185697666622033920857649.jpeg/DgS3gUO7mlN-FQ-UbsO21sO256QmuP3ZZWLKM1xiyjM\"/><figcaption>劉德華。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"張學友。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185697664281481216289035.jpeg/rji1cSojO83ImdFawmTEs7tlFnJD2G_GzPgYpPr4GKQ\"/><figcaption>張學友。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陣容鼎盛！（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185697661945122816302184.jpeg/9Glt1uElbJO0pkxZ3HY9HTfQu03m6Mk2_0od3spKHd4\"/><figcaption>陣容鼎盛！（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><p>而其他花籃的陣容都非常鼎盛，包括譚詠麟、容祖兒、胡楓、黃子華、古巨基、陳慧琳、張敬軒、梁詠琪、方力申、黃柏高等。</p><figure><img alt=\"梁詠琪。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702414544670720894716.jpeg/klbQe6INDj3_S1a4noOa_xn0hqFInAiLnMOiV6nDolc\"/><figcaption>梁詠琪。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"方力申。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702412032151552264785.jpeg/ta3yZPT2G-0sIwCgcBkR5k49VWLDxyeouy6DJo4ugyY\"/><figcaption>方力申。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳慧琳。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702428642119680630952.jpeg/l7RjYwTSuMlIJKMbl7OGLRie_7-jCxVM2MKaieHCmok\"/><figcaption>陳慧琳。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"叻哥夫婦。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702426502893568408963.jpeg/w3J6Lh0HIPHsra8kJBfuOFgfA3Qi3l6NMHQsfAV0LHw\"/><figcaption>叻哥夫婦。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702424359473152963874.jpeg/Uv7_smMKOc6jKK7-AewTKc_XP5gBJCHfVx43D1ceNw8\"/><figure><img alt=\"黃子華。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702422195081216615492.jpeg/2k1oSHtajeLptluCfL6fhHgRY_pmm7LBJ8WPNhLFjzY\"/><figcaption>黃子華。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"丁子高楊千嬅。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702419825168384697812.jpeg/9TAFX-C6F94VChJio1mzpVPAChjK-lGSgdeZPbTXmT0\"/><figcaption>丁子高楊千嬅。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"草蜢。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702425320230912062947.jpeg/ulU1WqB5yFvxbFn8ldK6mZsIoylRaolI6CCortEgqK4\"/><figcaption>草蜢。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"謝霆鋒。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702423118090240764523.jpeg/J_jglk8pEzXtOEzk6csMPiI4qHCktD269bnrh8y564c\"/><figcaption>謝霆鋒。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古巨基。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702420966281216361725.jpeg/-y7VrjDgY9lwMTCh4cZUNY2u6zSN-ZiGLnC2nRtwtp0\"/><figcaption>古巨基。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李克勤夫婦。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702418734780416490256.jpeg/XSJFkKEpylgl8FqHtrlh3EGBTQI3giGQKXVX7hx1V-4\"/><figcaption>李克勤夫婦。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"成龍。（盧振輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261010/1185702416448753664286791.jpeg/c54a4vFpFzRU-966pa94fuXQMxLwJRSYyY9AMfyPQDE\"/><figcaption>成龍。（盧振輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T13:38:51.502236+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":405,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}